1. A display apparatus comprising:  
a display panel;  
a frame disposed behind the display panel and including a bottom portion and a sidewall extending from the bottom portion;  
a plurality of light sources disposed on the bottom portion of the frame; and  
a rectangular reflective sheet disposed over the bottom portion of the frame and configured to reflect light emitted from the plurality of light sources toward the display panel, the rectangular reflective sheet including:  
a plurality of light source holes through which the plurality of light sources are respectively exposed;  
an extension extending outward from at least one edge of the rectangular reflective sheet toward the sidewall of the frame; and  
a plurality of light-reducing dots disposed on the rectangular reflective sheet,  
wherein sizes of the plurality of light-reducing dots vary according to positions of the plurality of light-reducing dots on the rectangular reflective sheet to reduce luminance non-uniformity of light provided to the display panel.
